erent ways, and you'll discover dozens of new ways to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Start with a &quot;sky fortress&quot;: use Maychelle's Ultimate to summon a high platform, load it up with gear, and turn it into an impenetrable stronghold. Climb up and dominate the battlefield from above!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Pair Beau's bombing abilities with Sparky, and deliver nonstop bombardment that turns every fight into a work of explosive art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Combine Freddie's teleportation skill with Squeaky. Dash up close, deal damage, then blink back. It's guerrilla warfare at its finest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> There's no one way to win. Every shot opens up new possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928420/extras/fec37e9cbfcbbdf69b750bd81be71dcb.poster.avif?t=1754530648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928420/extras/fec37e9cbfcbbdf69b750bd81be71dcb.webm?t=1754530648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928420/extras/fec37e9cbfcbbdf69b750bd81be71dcb.mp4?t=1754530648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>So gear up, grab your gun, and show the world what you're made of in Farlight 84!</strong></p>",
